; menu.dat -- CP/M-86 application menu sample
; Lines starting with ; are comments. Blank lines are ignored.

T CP/M-86 application menu version 1.0

E  Program with return menu | HELLO
E! Progam exit after        | HELLO
S  Batch with menu          | BATCH PARAM1
S! Batch exit after         | BATCH PARAM2
C  Chain with return menu   | HELLO
C! Chain exit after         | HELLO
M  Sub-menu 1 (no quit)     | menu1.dat
M  Sub-menu 2               | menu2.dat
